{"id":89,"name":"الفجر","transliteration":"Al-Fajr","translation_fr":"L'aube","translation_en":"The Dawn","type":"meccan","total_verses":30,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلۡفَجۡرِ","translation_fr":"Par l'Aube","translation_en":"By the dawn","transliteration":"Waalfajri"},{"id":2,"text":"وَلَيَالٍ عَشۡرٖ","translation_fr":"Et par les dix nuits","translation_en":"And [by] ten nights","transliteration":"Walayalin AAashrin"},{"id":3,"text":"وَٱلشَّفۡعِ وَٱلۡوَتۡرِ","translation_fr":"Par le pair et l'impair","translation_en":"And [by] the even [number] and the odd","transliteration":"WaalshshafAAi waalwatri"},{"id":4,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا يَسۡرِ","translation_fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle s'écoule","translation_en":"And [by] the night when it passes","transliteration":"Waallayli itha yasri"},{"id":5,"text":"هَلۡ فِي ذَٰلِكَ قَسَمٞ لِّذِي حِجۡرٍ","translation_fr":"N'est-ce pas là un serment, pour un doué d'intelligence","translation_en":"Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception","transliteration":"Hal fee thalika qasamun lithee hijrin"},{"id":6,"text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ كَيۡفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِعَادٍ","translation_fr":"N'as-tu pas vu comment ton Seigneur a agi avec les 'Aad","translation_en":"Have you not considered how your Lord dealt with 'Aad","transliteration":"Alam tara kayfa faAAala rabbuka biAAadin"},{"id":7,"text":"إِرَمَ ذَاتِ ٱلۡعِمَادِ","translation_fr":"[avec] Iram, [la cité] à la colonne remarquable","translation_en":"[With] Iram - who had lofty pillars","transliteration":"Irama thati alAAimadi"},{"id":8,"text":"ٱلَّتِي لَمۡ يُخۡلَقۡ مِثۡلُهَا فِي ٱلۡبِلَٰدِ","translation_fr":"dont jamais pareille ne fut construite parmi les villes","translation_en":"The likes of whom had never been created in the land","transliteration":"Allatee lam yukhlaq mithluha fee albiladi"},{"id":9,"text":"وَثَمُودَ ٱلَّذِينَ جَابُواْ ٱلصَّخۡرَ بِٱلۡوَادِ","translation_fr":"et avec les Thamûd qui taillaient le rocher dans la vallée","translation_en":"And [with] Thamud, who carved out the rocks in the valley","transliteration":"Wathamooda allatheena jaboo alssakhra bialwadi"},{"id":10,"text":"وَفِرۡعَوۡنَ ذِي ٱلۡأَوۡتَادِ","translation_fr":"ainsi qu'avec Pharaon, l'homme aux épieux","translation_en":"And [with] Pharaoh, owner of the stakes","transliteration":"WafirAAawna thee alawtadi"},{"id":11,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ طَغَوۡاْ فِي ٱلۡبِلَٰدِ","translation_fr":"Tous, étaient des gens qui transgressaient dans [leurs] pays","translation_en":"[All of] whom oppressed within the lands","transliteration":"Allatheena taghaw fee albiladi"},{"id":12,"text":"فَأَكۡثَرُواْ فِيهَا ٱلۡفَسَادَ","translation_fr":"et y avaient commis beaucoup de désordre","translation_en":"And increased therein the corruption","transliteration":"Faaktharoo feeha alfasada"},{"id":13,"text":"فَصَبَّ عَلَيۡهِمۡ رَبُّكَ سَوۡطَ عَذَابٍ","translation_fr":"Donc, ton Seigneur déversa sur eux un fouet du châtiment","translation_en":"So your Lord poured upon them a scourge of punishment","transliteration":"Fasabba AAalayhim rabbuka sawta AAathabin"},{"id":14,"text":"إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَبِٱلۡمِرۡصَادِ","translation_fr":"Car ton Seigneur demeure aux aguets","translation_en":"Indeed, your Lord is in observation","transliteration":"Inna rabbaka labialmirsadi"},{"id":15,"text":"فَأَمَّا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ إِذَا مَا ٱبۡتَلَىٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَأَكۡرَمَهُۥ وَنَعَّمَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّيٓ أَكۡرَمَنِ","translation_fr":"Quant à l'homme, lorsque son Seigneur l'éprouve en l'honorant et en le comblant de bienfaits, il dit: «Mon Seigneur m'a honoré»","translation_en":"And as for man, when his Lord tries him and [thus] is generous to him and favors him, he says, \"My Lord has honored me","transliteration":"Faamma alinsanu itha ma ibtalahu rabbuhu faakramahu wanaAAAAamahu fayaqoolu rabbee akramani"},{"id":16,"text":"وَأَمَّآ إِذَا مَا ٱبۡتَلَىٰهُ فَقَدَرَ عَلَيۡهِ رِزۡقَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّيٓ أَهَٰنَنِ","translation_fr":"Mais par contre, quand Il l'éprouve en lui restreignant sa subsistance, il dit: «Mon Seigneur m'a avili»","translation_en":"But when He tries him and restricts his provision, he says, \"My Lord has humiliated me","transliteration":"Waamma itha ma ibtalahu faqadara AAalayhi rizqahu fayaqoolu rabbee ahanani"},{"id":17,"text":"كَلَّاۖ بَل لَّا تُكۡرِمُونَ ٱلۡيَتِيمَ","translation_fr":"Mais non! C'est vous plutôt, qui n'êtes pas généreux envers les orphelins","translation_en":"No! But you do not honor the orphan","transliteration":"Kalla bal la tukrimoona alyateema"},{"id":18,"text":"وَلَا تَحَـٰٓضُّونَ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلۡمِسۡكِينِ","translation_fr":"qui ne vous incitez pas mutuellement à nourrir le pauvre","translation_en":"And you do not encourage one another to feed the poor","transliteration":"Wala tahaddoona AAala taAAami almiskeeni"},{"id":19,"text":"وَتَأۡكُلُونَ ٱلتُّرَاثَ أَكۡلٗا لَّمّٗا","translation_fr":"qui dévorez l'héritage avec une avidité vorace","translation_en":"And you consume inheritance, devouring [it] altogether","transliteration":"Watakuloona altturatha aklan lamman"},{"id":20,"text":"وَتُحِبُّونَ ٱلۡمَالَ حُبّٗا جَمّٗا","translation_fr":"et aimez les richesses d'un amour sans bornes","translation_en":"And you love wealth with immense love","transliteration":"Watuhibboona almala hubban jamman"},{"id":21,"text":"كَلَّآۖ إِذَا دُكَّتِ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ دَكّٗا دَكّٗا","translation_fr":"Prenez garde! Quand la terre sera complètement pulvérisée","translation_en":"No! When the earth has been leveled - pounded and crushed","transliteration":"Kalla itha dukkati alardu dakkan dakkan"},{"id":22,"text":"وَجَآءَ رَبُّكَ وَٱلۡمَلَكُ صَفّٗا صَفّٗا","translation_fr":"et que ton Seigneur viendra ainsi que les Anges, rang par rang","translation_en":"And your Lord has come and the angels, rank upon rank","transliteration":"Wajaa rabbuka waalmalaku saffan saffan"},{"id":23,"text":"وَجِاْيٓءَ يَوۡمَئِذِۭ بِجَهَنَّمَۚ يَوۡمَئِذٖ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ وَأَنَّىٰ لَهُ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"et que ce jour-là, on amènera l'Enfer; ce jour-là, l'homme se rappellera. Mais à quoi lui servira de se souvenir","translation_en":"And brought [within view], that Day, is Hell - that Day, man will remember, but what good to him will be the remembrance","transliteration":"Wajeea yawmaithin bijahannama yawmaithin yatathakkaru alinsanu waanna lahu alththikra"},{"id":24,"text":"يَقُولُ يَٰلَيۡتَنِي قَدَّمۡتُ لِحَيَاتِي","translation_fr":"Il dira: «Hélas! Que n'ai-je fait du bien pour ma vie future","translation_en":"He will say, \"Oh, I wish I had sent ahead [some good] for my life","transliteration":"Yaqoolu ya laytanee qaddamtu lihayatee"},{"id":25,"text":"فَيَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّا يُعَذِّبُ عَذَابَهُۥٓ أَحَدٞ","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là donc, nul ne saura châtier comme Lui châtie","translation_en":"So on that Day, none will punish [as severely] as His punishment","transliteration":"Fayawmaithin la yuAAaththibu AAathabahu ahadun"},{"id":26,"text":"وَلَا يُوثِقُ وَثَاقَهُۥٓ أَحَدٞ","translation_fr":"et nul ne saura garrotter comme Lui garrotte","translation_en":"And none will bind [as severely] as His binding [of the evildoers]","transliteration":"Wala yoothiqu wathaqahu ahadun"},{"id":27,"text":"يَـٰٓأَيَّتُهَا ٱلنَّفۡسُ ٱلۡمُطۡمَئِنَّةُ","translation_fr":"«O toi, âme apaisée","translation_en":"[To the righteous it will be said], \"O reassured soul","transliteration":"Ya ayyatuha alnnafsu almutmainnatu"},{"id":28,"text":"ٱرۡجِعِيٓ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكِ رَاضِيَةٗ مَّرۡضِيَّةٗ","translation_fr":"retourne vers ton Seigneur, satisfaite et agréée","translation_en":"Return to your Lord, well-pleased and pleasing [to Him]","transliteration":"IrjiAAee ila rabbiki radiyatan mardiyyatan"},{"id":29,"text":"فَٱدۡخُلِي فِي عِبَٰدِي","translation_fr":"entre donc parmi Mes serviteurs","translation_en":"And enter among My [righteous] servants","transliteration":"Faodkhulee fee AAibadee"},{"id":30,"text":"وَٱدۡخُلِي جَنَّتِي","translation_fr":"et entre dans Mon Paradis»","translation_en":"And enter My Paradise","transliteration":"Waodkhulee jannatee"}]}